<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb wholesale prices rise 0.7 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 07:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb wholesale prices rise 0.7 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 07:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index rose 0.7 percent in February year-on-year and it rose 0.1 percent month-on-month Statistics Finland said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Corrects to clarify that first figure is year-on-year comparison and the second a month-on-month comparison).</p>
<p>			     Feb 1997     Jan 1997    Feb 1996</p>
<p> Yr/yr		     +0.7 pct     +0.6 pct    +0.8 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		   +0.1 pct     +0.4 pct    +0.1 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
